{{Quote|An elegant sword full of energy, that scatters petals when used.|Item}}
'''Canvander''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].   

Canvander has a fast, mobility-focused moveset, featuring two dash-based abilities that allow quick repositioning, chase potential, and strong [[Instinct]] drain. Although underrated and not commonly used in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] builds, its straightforward aiming and high mobility make it effective for players who prefer speed and evasive playstyles over raw damage.  

However, its dash-based M1s, smaller hitboxes, and limited combo potential make it less effective for grinding and harder to use compared to more popular swords. 

==Obtainment==
Canvander can be obtained after defeating the [[Beautiful Pirate]].

